# src/apps/android/app/src/androidTest

## Purpose
Defines the Android instrumentation-test source set used to exercise application behavior on an Android runtime or emulator.

## Contents
Contains the Java/Kotlin package hierarchy and device-facing integration tests beneath this source set.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Discovered by Gradle and the Android test runner; tests may depend on the app-under-test and Android test libraries.

## Invariants
Code here is test-only, must not be packaged as production application logic, and should keep device/emulator side effects isolated and reproducible.